                {
                    "id": "709390101",
                    "speaker": "Player",
                    "text": "Materials?"
                },
                {
                    "id": "709390102",
                    "speaker": "Orban",
                    "text": "I've tried forging weapons from all kinds of materials. But each and every one of them has turned out to be completely unexceptional."
                },
                {
                    "id": "709390103",
                    "speaker": "Orban",
                    "text": "This has led me to understand the limitations of ordinary ores..."
                },
                {
                    "id": "709390104",
